    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBright, spacious and superbly positioned, No. 46 The Ramparts is a stylish two-bedroom first-floor apartment offering generously proportioned accommodation, excellent natural light and a large private balcony within this highly regarded residential development.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the apartment is notable for its sense of space and brightness, with expansive windows and French doors creating an airy and welcoming living environment. The accommodation includes a wide entrance hall with excellent storage, a particularly spacious living and dining room opening directly onto the balcony, and a separate fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances.\n\nBoth bedrooms are generous doubles with extensive built-in wardrobe space, while the principal bedroom also benefits from its own en-suite shower room. A well-appointed main bathroom completes the accommodation.\nThe property has recently been enhanced with newly installed high-efficiency electric heaters and also benefits from double-glazed windows and a secure designated parking space within the underground car park.\n\nThe location is difficult to beat. The Ramparts enjoys a superb residential setting just off the N11, with Cabinteely Village, Cherrywood Village and Cornelscourt all within easy reach. Dunnes Stores Cornelscourt, Carrickmines Retail Park and the extensive amenities at Cherrywood are close by, while excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin city centre and the wider South Dublin area.\n\nFor those seeking outdoor and leisure amenities, Cabinteely Park, local walking routes, golf courses, tennis and rugby clubs are all nearby, while a wide selection of well-regarded schools and third-level colleges are also readily accessible.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, excellent natural light, a large private balcony, secure designated underground parking and a superbly convenient location, No. 46 The Ramparts is an exceptionally appealing apartment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nWood flooring, recessed lighting, telephone intercom to hall door, hot press and separate utility cupboard.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - \nWood flooring, recessed lighting, expansive windows providing excellent natural light and double French doors opening onto the large private balcony.\n\nKitchen: - \nTiled floor, extensive range of built-in floor and eye-level units with worktops over and tiled upstands, integrated dishwasher, integrated Zanussi oven with four-ring ceramic hob and stainless-steel canopy extractor hood over, integrated fridge freezer, plumbed for washing machine and spotlights.\n\nPrincipal Bedroom: - \nWood flooring, newly installed high-efficiency electric heater and extensive range of built-in his-and-hers wardrobes.\n\nEn Suite: - \nTiled floor, shower cubicle, wash hand basin, w/c, extractor fan and Dimplex electric heater.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nWood flooring and extensive range of built-in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom: - \nTiled floor, half-tiled walls, bath with tiled surround and telephone shower attachment over, wash hand basin, w/c, large wall-mounted mirror, strip light with shaving socket, Dimplex electric heater and extractor fan.\n\nBalcony: - \nLarge private balcony accessed directly from the living/dining room, providing excellent additional outdoor space.\n\nService Charge: - \n2,417 (2026)\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Bright and spacious two-bedroom first-floor apartment presented in excellent condition throughout</li><li> Generously proportioned living and dining room with expansive glazing and direct access to a large private balcony</li><li> Newly installed high-efficiency electric heaters together with double-glazed windows</li><li> Two generous double bedrooms, both with extensive built-in wardrobe space, with the principal bedroom also enjoying an en-suite shower room</li><li> Separate fully fitted kitchen with an extensive range of units and integrated appliances</li><li> Excellent storage including a hot press and separate utility cupboard</li><li> Secure designated parking space within the underground car park</li><li> Large private balcony providing excellent additional outdoor living space</li><li> Superb residential location within easy reach of Cabinteely Village, Cherrywood Village and Cornelscourt</li><li> Convenient to the N11, Carrickmines Retail Park, Cherrywood and excellent public transport links</li><li> Excellent selection of nearby recreational amenities including Cabinteely Park, walking routes, golf courses, tennis and rugby clubs</ul>"
      },
